==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 70~73.33 seconds<sup>2,100f~2,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Medu-san]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Li'l Zyclone]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Cadaver Bear]]s spawn, delay 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be extremely difficult without the right cat units to counter it. Any Surge Immune or otherwise Generalist/anti-Aku crowd-controllers units will help immensely to counter the Boss, Medu-san.

After killing Mooth and hit the base, the stage will become money-tight, so feel free to stall the beginning peons, level up your Wallet, and then manage your money carefully.

On base hit, 2 waves of Cadaver Bears and Li'l Zyclones will spawn, so your goal should be to gun down these paired threats before they stack up, and make it significantly harder to hold any ground. Any Cats that can Z-Kill and/or snipe Cadaver Bear from a safe distance will prove immensely useful. It is crucial that you do not let Cadaver Bear revive, as it may spell fatality for your run.

Holy Blast Cannon is highly recommended to un-burrow both Cadaver Bear and Li'l Zyclone before they cut off and annihilate your front line.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]]: A very durable & cost-efficient option to help take down Li'l Zyclone and Zombie peons.
*[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]]: A great Meatshield at stalling and tanking Cadaver Bear, provided you have some way to deal with Medu-san.
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]: A solid Midranger on her own to deal with the peons, as well as chipping down & inflicting [[Slow]] on Li'l Zyclone.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]]: Li'l Zyclone and the peons provide excellent stepping stones to Wave and chip down the threatening Backliners.
*[[Evil Egg: N003|Cat Cactus]] & [[Talents|Talented]] [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]]: Accessible [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immune]] units to maintain ground and slow Medu-san's push.
*[[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]]: Able to push back and snipe Medu-San, cutting down its Surge frequency. If stacked, he can easily juggle her and hold the front line, although do keep in mind he needs a lot of support due to his fragility.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Summoner Satoru (Uber Rare Cat)|Devil Hunter Satoru]]: If you are lucky enough to have him, can trivialise this stage by juggling Medu-san.
*Ubers from the [[Iron Legion]] set can completely demolish this stage, with many being able to completely counter the 2 Cadaver Bears.

